The evaluator: expands references through specialization, detects cycles, and runs filters.
@[internal/litar/eval.go@`go module@=
@<eval@:litar@:Language@/Go@/File@/file@>@

@<eval@:litar@:Language@/Go@/File@/import paths@+
"fmt"
"io"
"strings"
"sync"
@

cycleError reports a circular chunk reference chain encountered during expansion.
@<eval@:litar@:Language@/Go@/File@/types@+
type cycleError struct {
	chain []ChunkRef
}

@~ Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.ChunkRef @? Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.cycleError @

frame records an active chunk expansion on the evaluator's visit stack.
@<eval@:litar@:Language@/Go@/File@/types@+
type frame struct {
	key string
	ref ChunkRef
}

@~ Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.ChunkRef @? Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.frame @

Evaluator expands chunk references on one node chain. The mutex is held across in-memory expansion and released around filter execution, which may mount a filesystem and block. byChunk indexes the chain by module and chunk name in chain order. deps holds the dependencies of each file being expanded, innermost last.
@<eval@:litar@:Language@/Go@/File@/types@+
type Evaluator struct {
	mu      sync.Mutex
	byChunk map[string][]Block
	cat     *catalog
	stack   []frame
	deps    []map[string]dependency
	fuseErr error
	stderr  io.Writer
}

@~ Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.Block @? Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.Evaluator @~ Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.catalog @~ Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.dependency @~ Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.frame @

fileCache holds the files evaluated in this process, by path.
An evaluated file is kept for the rest of the process,
so a file is evaluated again only when something it depends on changes.
Filters and mapped files are assumed to give the same output for the same blocks:
a file whose filter reads the outside world keeps its first output.
@<eval@:litar@:Language@/Go@/File@/variables@+
var fileCache = struct {
	sync.Mutex
	files map[string]cachedFile
}{files: map[string]cachedFile{}}

@~ Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.cachedFile @? Project@/litar@/Go@/variables@/litar.fileCache @

cachedFile pairs an evaluated archive file's text with the chunk and view dependencies it used.
@<eval@:litar@:Language@/Go@/File@/types@+
type cachedFile struct {
	text string
	deps map[string]dependency
}

@? Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.cachedFile @~ Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.dependency @

A dependency is a chunk an evaluation expanded or the view of a filter it ran,
with a digest of the blocks matching the chunk or of the files in the view.
@<eval@:litar@:Language@/Go@/File@/types@+
type dependency struct {
	ref    ChunkRef
	view   []ViewOp
	isView bool
	sum    [sha256.Size]byte
}

@~ Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.ChunkRef @~ Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.ViewOp @? Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.dependency @

@<eval@:litar@:Language@/Go@/File@/import paths@+
"crypto/sha256"
@

