@~ Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.ChunkRef @~ Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.Item @~ Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.Name @? Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.nameSpan @~ Project@/litar@/Go@/types@/litar.spanRole @
A spanScanner walks the text of one block and collects its names.
The parser keeps no positions, and only a rewrite needs them, so the names are found
by a second walk over the text of a block that already parsed.
