Each path is a fresh copy, since the walk extends it for every subtree.
@<Project@/litar@/MCP Server@/record the place of 'node' at 'path' in 'out', then walk its subtrees@=
out[node.Ref] = treePlace{names: append([]string{}, path...), leaf: node.Leaf}
