A node created with a select field reads only what it selects, its meta chunks included,
but evaluates the whole chain; blocks://define lists the blocks defining an item.
Selecting 'word' shows 'word', 'msg', which contains it and refers to its item,
and the description of the item; 'out.txt', 'other', and 'unrelated' stay hidden.
